   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "One stood up named Agabus there",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By the Spirit he made a declaration",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A severe famine over the whole world",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the days of Claudius it unfurled",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He warned of the hunger that would come",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He warned of the binding to be done",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Spirit spoke through the prophet\u2019s voice",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To show the path of the man\u2019s choice",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Disciples decided to send relief",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
