   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To brothers living in Judea\u2019s land",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Barnabas and Saul carried the plan",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then in Caesarea the days went by",
